# Scarlet Spider, Kaine: the discard is optional ("you may discard", CR 608.2d) and the counter follows only "if you do". With cards in hand
# and the choice declined, he stays a 2/1 with no counter and nothing is discarded.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Scarlet Spider, Kaine
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
